310393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19","html_url":"https://github.com/JBlank19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JBlank19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T16:55:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T16:55:56Z","body":"Here is a MWP for 4.4.beta3, again the bus layout has 3 buses set up like this:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ed129ca-51a3-4e2b-8fe8-6a484111b512)\n\nThe scene looks like this:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6d7b3b1-db90-4d31-8625-46524c0afd48)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5e4dc90-0736-4141-b611-ac80db77bc40)\n\nAnd the script is here\n\n[CaptureScript.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18754735/CaptureScript.txt)\n\nResulting audio is broken for 44.1 kHz systems:\n\n[debug_acc_frames_44beta3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18754750/debug_acc_frames_44beta3.zip)\n\nHopefully this is useful!\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2651455729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2651485170","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102701#issuecomment-2651485170","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102701","id":2651485170,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eCnPy","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T17:07:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T17:07:24Z","body":"Is the 44.1 kHz setup using surround sound? In this case, I suggest testing https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92532 locally (see [Testing pull requests](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/workflow/testing_pull_requests.html)).\n\nTypically, I'd also suggest adjusting the capture rate to match the output audio rate, however, Godot already defaults to 44100 Hz output by default, so that's probably not the cause.\n\nHowever, recent changes were made to AudioStreamGenerator to allow it to automatically adjust itself to the input/output mix rate: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102691","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2651485170/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoo